1
00:00:05,161 --> 00:00:05,761
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

2
00:00:06,196 --> 00:00:08,606
What could we do that's fun?

3
00:00:08,765 --> 00:00:10,435
What could we do that's different?

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,340
What could we do that's free?

5
00:00:15,538 --> 00:00:18,348
Got it! We order a pizza.

6
00:00:18,508 --> 00:00:21,178
(Penny:)Are you kidding? That's what you
always do. Think harder.

7
00:00:21,344 --> 00:00:24,384
(Sheldon:)You're right. You're right.
Got it!

8
00:00:24,547 --> 00:00:28,997
(Sheldon:)We order calzones, cut them open,
eat them like pizza.

9
00:00:30,353 --> 00:00:32,803
All right! All right!
I'll shake the brain bush one more time,

10
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:34,956
(Sheldon:)see what falls out.

11
00:00:35,125 --> 00:00:38,165
Got it! There's a live-action
role-playing group

12
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:40,308
(Sheldon:)that meets every Thursday night
in Griffith Park

13
00:00:40,463 --> 00:00:43,173
(Sheldon:)and reenacts battles
from Lord of the Rings.

14
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:46,743
Okay, tell me more
about this calzone idea.

15
00:00:48,138 --> 00:00:50,418
(Leonard:)You know what?
Why don't we just ease into this.

16
00:00:50,573 --> 00:00:54,183
(Leonard:)Let's go for a walk
and see if we find a new restaurant.

17
00:00:54,344 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)Any chance that restaurant
is near Griffith Park?

